      "writtenOn": "2021-07-09T03:20:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What changes is previously only mapped attachments were reported. Now all attachments are reported (mapped or not).\n\nThis is more inline with the gpu_mem_total tracepoint which reports the imported memory (not necessarily mapped). Since these attachment stats are used to deduce the gpu private from gpu_mem_total (private + imported), all attachments should be reported as is done here.\n\nThis is what allows to drop the attachment map_count fields.",
      "parentUuid": "03d89322_663b813c",
      "revId": "8a73c5c6ca9426dc3270f7213af8242f41e562b3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
